{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Become a legendary gunslinger and roam a Wild West filled with danger and glory!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a <strong>Wild West Gunslinger</strong> theme 2D <strong>RPG</strong>, <br>you\u2019ll step into the vast, fictional land known as the <i>Westland</i> \u2014  <br>a place full with ruthless outlaws, wild beasts lurking in the wilderness, and secrets waiting to be uncovered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Draw Your Gun</strong> \u2013 Face notorious gangs and ferocious beasts, and prove your skill and courage!<br><strong>Explore</strong>\u2013 Take on side quests, bounty hunting, and upgrade your gear. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>More Than Gunfights</strong> \u2013 Enjoy fishing, horse racing, and other activities that bring your journey to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But in the shadows of this vast frontier,<br>an infamous criminal organization known as <strong>&quot;Deathly Thirteen&quot;</strong> is on the rise.<br>As the gunslinger chosen by fate, you will play a pivotal role in the fight against them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Load your weapon and write your own legend! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique battle system where you need to control the player to dodge and shoot the enemies. You will battle with different type of enemies. From Outlaws to Wild Beasts. Different weapon options are available to choose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242510/extras/50f8c92a90e151a608e0fc2bcac098f1.avif?t=1770341164\" width=1600 height=900 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242510/extras/25c88e5bb6fdcb366bef83a589a85126.avif?t=1770341164\" width=1593 height=897 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story mode- Play as a legendary Jack Silver to uncover the mysteries of Westland and Deathly Thirteen</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242510/extras/3341feba4ee69b03f5db34428d68ae23.avif?t=1770341164\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242510/extras/e91bd0fe956e39f6424ac93783fb76a7.avif?t=1770341164\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aside from the story and battle system, there will Quest system where player can accept quest from Tavern. And also player can buy items and equipment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242510/extras/61d13a1f233bb5b1cdc6ae280ddcb32b.avif?t=1770341164\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242510/extras/34fb10052d10ba1cb3863b92f9fe30ba.avif?t=1770341164\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242510/extras_big/34fb10052d10ba1cb3863b92f9fe30ba.avif?t=1770341164 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242510/extras/c3dd98d0d4677ef342f1d3f3759d1b45.avif?t=1770341164\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242510/extras_big/c3dd98d0d4677ef342f1d3f3759d1b45.avif?t=1770341164 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are also side activities where player can try to complete and unlock. Such as Horse Racing and Fishi